  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YR2 of 5 PYMNT of the Project &apos;Credit Union Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to promote financial inclusion and reduce poverty for Sierra Leoneans through further embedding of a safe, secure and growing Credit Union movement with its philosophy and values of inclusion and community. It is envisaged that a growing movement will help strengthen the capacity of members and their communities to effectively prepare, respond and recover from livelihood stresses and shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
